{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend the Forest. Singleplayer or Coop!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/e682ebcd6484d2226bd832ccd5bf7187.poster.avif?t=1764837686\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/e682ebcd6484d2226bd832ccd5bf7187.webm?t=1764837686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/e682ebcd6484d2226bd832ccd5bf7187.mp4?t=1764837686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a living mushroom bound to the ancient mycelium, defending the forest\u2019s balance against spreading corruption. Face endless waves of twisted insects in a dark-fantasy bullet-hell survivors-like. Team up online, share progress, and combine powers to stand against the swarm together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progress Beyond Death</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/5f98dc4c6bd57abc73e349ffac6ce8bf.poster.avif?t=1764837686\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/5f98dc4c6bd57abc73e349ffac6ce8bf.webm?t=1764837686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/5f98dc4c6bd57abc73e349ffac6ce8bf.mp4?t=1764837686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new characters, upgrades, and permanent bonuses between runs. Each attempt brings you closer to mastering the forest\u2019s true power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evolve Your Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/cee4b3ffdf4b5d189842f8f6a6cde515.poster.avif?t=1764837686\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/cee4b3ffdf4b5d189842f8f6a6cde515.webm?t=1764837686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/cee4b3ffdf4b5d189842f8f6a6cde515.mp4?t=1764837686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather mushrooms to awaken the forest\u2019s power! Thorn strike, spores burst, and nature fights beside you. Strengthen yourself and the forest to unleash devastating synergy attacks, evolving or unlocking new abilities for unique builds and powerful combinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3701190?t=1764837686","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/e2b93fd8946a60b655fc7dc58dc832e0ea37b657/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764837686","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/395e9811e16f5c2f2bd5d8cb44c0c40adfde5cf6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764837686","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/395e9811e16f5c2f2bd5d8cb44c0c40adfde5cf6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764837686","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Don't forget to wishlist!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/1887bb3f7d6f16c877a803c84e3c3d24.avif?t=1764837686\" width=700 height=228 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend the Forest. Singleplayer or Coop!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/e682ebcd6484d2226bd832ccd5bf7187.poster.avif?t=1764837686\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/e682ebcd6484d2226bd832ccd5bf7187.webm?t=1764837686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/e682ebcd6484d2226bd832ccd5bf7187.mp4?t=1764837686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a living mushroom bound to the ancient mycelium, defending the forest\u2019s balance against spreading corruption. Face endless waves of twisted insects in a dark-fantasy bullet-hell survivors-like. Team up online, share progress, and combine powers to stand against the swarm together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progress Beyond Death</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701190/extras/5f98dc4c6bd57abc73e349ffac6ce8bf.poster.avif?t=1764837686\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.